{"lang": "", "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "But there is always a stronger sense of life when the sun is brilliant after rain. And now he is pouring down his beams, and making sparkles among the wet straw, and lighting up every patch of vivid green moss on the red tiles of the cow shed, and turning even the muddy water that is hurrying along the channel to the drain into a mirror for the yellow billed ducks, who are seizing the opportunity of getting a drink, with as much body in it as possible.", "timestamps": [0.32, 0.56, 0.80, 0.96, 1.12, 1.20, 1.36, 1.52, 1.76, 1.92, 2.16, 2.32, 2.48, 2.64, 2.88, 3.12, 3.44, 3.60, 3.84, 4.00, 4.16, 4.40, 4.56, 4.80, 5.04, 5.36, 5.84, 6.08, 6.32, 6.64, 6.88, 7.04, 7.36, 7.52, 7.76, 7.92, 8.16, 8.56, 8.72, 8.96, 9.20, 9.44, 9.68, 9.84, 10.00, 10.24, 10.40, 10.56, 10.72, 10.96, 11.20, 11.52, 11.92, 12.16, 12.40, 12.64, 12.88, 13.04, 13.28, 13.44, 13.68, 13.92, 14.08, 14.24, 14.56, 14.72, 14.96, 15.12, 15.36, 15.60, 15.84, 15.92, 16.16, 16.40, 16.64, 16.72, 16.88, 17.04, 17.36, 17.60, 18.00, 18.24, 18.48, 18.72, 18.96, 19.20, 19.36, 19.60, 19.76, 19.92, 20.16, 20.32, 20.48, 20.72, 20.88, 21.04, 21.12, 21.28, 21.36, 21.44, 21.52, 21.68, 21.84, 22.00, 22.24, 22.96, 23.28, 23.52, 23.84, 24.16, 24.40, 24.56, 24.72, 24.88, 25.04, 25.20, 25.36, 25.52, 25.68, 25.84, 26.00, 26.16, 26.40, 26.56, 26.72, 26.88, 27.04, 27.20, 27.36, 27.52, 27.76, 27.92, 28.08, 28.16, 28.32, 28.48, 28.72, 28.88, 29.12, 29.36, 29.52, 29.76, 30.00, 30.16, 30.24, 30.48, 30.72, 31.04, 31.36], "durations": [0.24, 0.24, 0.16, 0.16, 0.08, 0.16, 0.16, 0.24, 0.16, 0.24, 0.16, 0.16, 0.16, 0.24, 0.16, 0.32, 0.16, 0.16, 0.16, 0.16, 0.24, 0.16, 0.24, 0.24, 0.32, 0.32, 0.24, 0.24, 0.32, 0.24, 0.16, 0.32, 0.16, 0.24, 0.08, 0.24, 0.24, 0.16, 0.24, 0.24, 0.24, 0.24, 0.16, 0.16, 0.24, 0.16, 0.16, 0.16, 0.24, 0.24, 0.32, 0.32, 0.24, 0.24, 0.24, 0.24, 0.16, 0.24, 0.16, 0.24, 0.24, 0.16, 0.16, 0.32, 0.16, 0.24, 0.16, 0.24, 0.24, 0.24, 0.08, 0.24, 0.24, 0.16, 0.08, 0.16, 0.16, 