{"lang": "", "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "So persuasive were her entreaties, and so strong her assurances that no harm whatever could result to them from the information she sought, they were induced to confess that one summer's night, the same she had mentioned, themselves and another friend being out on a stroll with Rodolfo, they had been concerned in the abduction of a girl whom Rodolfo carried off, whilst the rest of them detained her family, who made a great outcry, and would have defended her if they could.", "timestamps": [0.32, 0.64, 0.88, 1.04, 1.28, 1.44, 1.60, 1.84, 2.24, 2.56, 2.72, 2.88, 3.12, 3.28, 3.52, 3.76, 3.92, 4.08, 4.24, 4.40, 4.56, 4.80, 4.96, 5.12, 5.28, 5.44, 5.60, 5.84, 6.24, 6.40, 6.72, 6.96, 7.20, 7.52, 7.76, 8.00, 8.16, 8.32, 8.56, 8.72, 8.96, 9.12, 9.28, 9.52, 9.60, 9.76, 10.00, 10.32, 10.56, 10.80, 11.04, 11.20, 11.28, 11.36, 11.52, 11.68, 11.92, 12.08, 12.24, 12.40, 12.64, 12.80, 12.96, 13.04, 13.20, 13.44, 13.68, 13.84, 14.00, 14.24, 14.32, 14.48, 14.64, 14.88, 15.12, 15.36, 15.52, 15.68, 15.84, 16.00, 16.16, 16.24, 16.32, 16.48, 16.64, 16.88, 17.04, 17.36, 17.52, 17.68, 17.92, 18.08, 18.24, 18.40, 18.56, 18.72, 18.88, 19.12, 19.36, 19.52, 19.68, 19.76, 19.92, 20.08, 20.24, 20.32, 20.48, 20.64, 20.80, 20.96, 21.28, 21.44, 21.60, 21.68, 22.00, 22.16, 22.32, 22.48, 22.56, 22.64, 22.88, 22.96, 23.12, 23.36, 23.52, 23.60, 23.76, 23.92, 24.08, 24.32, 24.48, 24.72, 24.80, 24.96, 25.04, 25.12, 25.28, 25.52, 25.76, 26.00, 26.08, 26.32, 26.56, 26.72, 26.80, 26.96, 27.12, 27.20, 27.36, 27.60, 27.76, 28.08], "durations": [0.32, 0.24, 0.16, 0.24, 0.16, 0.16, 0.24, 0.16, 0.16, 0.16, 0.16, 0.24, 0.16, 0.24, 0.24, 0.16, 0.16, 0.16, 0.16, 0.16, 0.24, 0.16, 0.16, 0.16, 0.16, 0.16, 0.24, 0.32, 0.16, 0.16, 0.24, 0.24, 0.32, 0.24, 0.24, 0.16, 0.16, 0.16, 0.16, 0.16, 0.16, 0.16, 0.24, 0.08, 0.16, 0.24, 0.32, 0.24, 0.24, 0.24, 0.16, 0.08, 0.08, 0.16, 0.16, 0.08, 0.16, 0.16, 0.16, 0.24, 0.16, 0.16, 0.08, 0.16, 0.24, 0.24, 0.16, 0.16, 0.24, 0.08, 0.